{"asset_key":"ep2/quest_story_12244040","episode":"ep2","category":"quest_story","story_id":"12244040","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:2:1224404001:1":{"text":"촌장님, 신밧드는 안 왔나요? 광장을 한 바퀴 둘러보았는데도 안 보여서요.","source_cn":"村长，辛巴达来了吗？我们在广场上找了一圈都没看到他。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA81199AD6BB74367","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1224404002:1":{"text":"이상하네... 조금 전까지만 해도 근처에 있었는데.","source_cn":"怪了……他刚才还在附近的。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x49045DA84D1AEF94","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1224404003:1":{"text":"블러디 로즈 사람에게 불려 간 게 아닐까? 아는 사람이 꽤 되는 것 같던데...","source_cn":"是不是被血薇帮的人叫走了？我记得他认识不少人……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x59E66FEF6063C94F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1224404004:1":{"text":"그런 거 아니야. 그 녀석이 그냥 숨은 거지.","source_cn":"没那回事，是那臭小子自己躲起来了。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC328CE5CC330C31D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1224404005:1":{"text":"어라? 왜 숨어요?","source_cn":"哎？他为什么要躲起来？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA1E1872E92D193B0","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"",